  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "单局20分钟内围绕生存、清扫僵尸、收集样本并兑换现金形成直接循环。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "In these 20 minutes, all you can do is survive, clean zombies, collect samples, and exchange them for cash.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2162680/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "清扫进度会逐步解锁多种空投军事支援，并提供额外的武器升级途径。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "As the cleaning progresses, you can unlock a variety of airdrop military support! You can even \"watch a show\" to upgrade your weapons.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2162680/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "失去家人的少女Yamato与Roche购入二手军车，在末日中踏上清扫者与军火生意之旅。",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "Yamato, a girl who has lost her family, and Roche, the top service boy of SOPRT BOY, have purchased a second-hand military vehicle from an A-grade arms company and embarked on the journey of the Sweepers.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2162680/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
